cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or software, please cite it as below."
title: "Fire Rings Harmonized Hotspot Record"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
authors:
  - name: "Murugun Sharma Roma Rishi"
license: [MIT, CC-BY-4.0]
repository-code: "https://github.com/Muru265/fire-rings"
url: "https://fire-rings.vercel.app"
abstract: >-
  A harmonized monthly record of MODIS (2001-) and VIIRS (2012-) active-fire hotspots from NASA FIRMS, expressed in
  MODIS-equivalent fire cell-days on an H3 resolution-6 grid, with bootstrap uncertainty, out-of-sample validation and
  "is this normal?" statistics for seven regions (Punjab-Haryana, Madagascar, SE Australia, Mauritius, Northern
  Australia savanna, Northeast India, Tanzania), updated daily for the current month.
keywords: [MODIS, VIIRS, active fire, FIRMS, harmonization, hotspots, H3]
references:
  - type: data
    title: "NASA FIRMS MODIS Collection 6.1 and VIIRS 375 m active fire detections (S-NPP, NOAA-20, NOAA-21)"
    authors:
      - name: "NASA Fire Information for Resource Management System (FIRMS), ESDIS"
    url: "https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/firms"
